# Context

## Background
The owner asked "commit all, push all, cut new version, reinstall new
version" on 2026-11-25. v0.8.0 is the first release with schema 9
(migration 009_source_workspace.sql). The release policy asks the
release change to list the schema that the release ships, so that the
released-schema upgrade tests cover it before the tag exists.

## Why This Way
TestMigrateUpgradesReleasedSchemas builds a database at each released
schema, seeds it, and opens it with the current store. For v0.8.0 the
seed failed on "table sources has no column named file_identity":
migration 009 drops that column, and the seed had never run on schema 9.
The seed now inserts file_identity only for schema 8 and below.

